 "note": "LUNENBURG PRIMARY SCHOOL FACULTY / STAFF ROSTER 2009 - 2010 is printed at lines 18-20; the principal and grades (preschool, K, 1, 2) confirm it. Lines 1-17 are the end of the principal's narrative, including the School Council membership (not a staff roster); line 76 is the page number. Two columns, each 'role  name'; Textract often prints a right-column role on one line and its name on the next (2C/Diane Riley, Tutor/Betsy Carbone, Tutor/Patricia McColl, Occupational Therapy/Maggie Porpora, COTA/Jane Dusek, Music/Debra Smith): the name is recorded on its own line with that role in role_raw. The right column at the top (2C-2F, Yoder, the tutors and Achieve teacher, specialists) has no section heading printed above it on this page, so grade_or_dept is empty; GRADE 2 is printed only at line 73 above 2A. Where the column of a person cannot be read from the layout (Biery, Broden, McColl, DeFelcie, Sheehy, Green, Caron, Xarras), grade_or_dept is left empty rather than guessed. Lines 30, 40, 58 hold a left section heading plus a right role label with its name on the next line. 2B is not printed."
